  "augment.mysticalagriculture.mining_fatigue_resistance.description": "免疫挖掘疲勞效果。",
  "augment.mysticalagriculture.hunger_resistance": "抗飢餓",
  "augment.mysticalagriculture.hunger_resistance.description": "免疫飢餓效果。",
  "augment.mysticalagriculture.absorption_v.description": "每 8 分鐘獲得 10 顆傷害吸收心。",
  "augment.mysticalagriculture.luck_iii": "幸運III",
  "augment.mysticalagriculture.luck_iii.description": "獲得幸運III。",
  "augment.mysticalagriculture.wither_resistance.description": "免疫凋零效果。",
  "augment.mysticalagriculture.health_boost_v.description": "最大生命值增加 10 顆心。",
  "augment.mysticalagriculture.strength_iii.description": "獲得力量III。",
  "augment.mysticalagriculture.haste_iii": "急迫III",
  "augment.mysticalagriculture.haste_iii.description": "獲得急迫III。",
  "augment.mysticalagriculture.flight.description": "獲得創造模式飛行能力。",
  "augment.mysticalagriculture.mining_aoe_iv.description": "範圍挖掘擴大為 9x9。",
  "augment.mysticalagriculture.attack_aoe_iii.description": "範圍攻擊擴大為 7x7。",
  "augment.mysticalagriculture.tilling_aoe_iv.description": "潛行時，範圍耕地擴大為 9x9。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.growth_accelerators.page.2": "生長加速器的作用範圍取決於它放在耕地下方。$(br2)$(l:https://blakesmods.com/wiki/mysticalagriculture/guides/speeding-up-crop-growth)點此查看生長加速器的詳細使用指南。$()",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.sickles": "鐮刀",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.sickles.page.1": "鐮刀用來收割或破壞大範圍的植物。$(br2)等級越高的鐮刀，作用範圍越大。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.scythes": "大鐮刀",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.scythes.page.1": "大鐮刀可透過右鍵點擊收割大範圍的作物，範圍內所有完全成熟的作物都會被收割，且不會被連根拔起。$(br2)大鐮刀也是有效的武器，攻擊範圍更大。$(br2)等級越高的大鐮刀，作用範圍越大。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.soulium_dagger.page.3": "被動調諧的離魂匕首，擊殺被動生物時可額外獲得百分之 50 的靈魂。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.soulium_dagger.page.4": "敵對調諧的離魂匕首，擊殺敵對生物時可額外獲得百分之 50 的靈魂。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.experience_capsule": "經驗膠囊",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.experience_capsule.page.1": "經驗膠囊用來收集經驗，以製作經驗種子。$(br2)想收集經驗，只要把一些經驗膠囊放在物品欄中，再撿起經驗球即可。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.enchanter": "附魔器",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.enchanter.page.1": "附魔器是一種方塊，可使用不同的合成材料與經驗精華為你的工具和盔甲附魔。$(br2)附魔器可以像鐵砧一樣，對書本以及工具與盔甲施加附魔。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.cognizant_dust": "認知粉",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.cognizant_dust.page.1": "認知粉$(bold)通常$()是使用附有神秘啟蒙的$(l:tinkering/essence_tools)精華武器$()擊殺凋零怪或終界龍而取得。$(br2)神秘啟蒙的等級越高，擊殺時掉落的粉末越多。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.essence_vessel": "精華容器",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.essence_vessel.page.1": "精華容器用於$(l:elemental/awakening_altar)覺醒祭壇$()結構中，存放合成物品所需的元素精華。每個容器最多可存放 40 個單一種類的元素精華。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.awakening_altar": "覺醒祭壇",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.awakening_altar.page.1": "覺醒祭壇是一種合成結構，$(bold)通常$()用來製作$(l:elemental/awakened_supremium)覺醒終極精華$()。此結構由 1 個注魔祭壇、4 個注魔基座與 4 個$(l:elemental/essence_vessel)精華容器$()組成。$(br2)放好配方後，只要用紅石訊號啟動祭壇即可。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.awakening_altar.page.3": "把覺醒祭壇放置在世界中，就會顯示基座與容器該放的位置。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.awakened_supremium": "覺醒終極精華",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.awakened_supremium.page.1": "覺醒終極精華是高階合成材料，用來製作許多終極精華物品的升級版本。$(br2)覺醒終極精華$(bold)通常$()是使用$(l:elemental/awakening_altar)覺醒祭壇$()，將$(l:elemental/cognizant_dust)認知粉$()注入終極精華塊而成。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.machine_upgrades": "機器升級",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.machine_upgrades.page.1": "機器升級可放入對應的機器中，提升其效能。$(br2)等級越高的機器，耗能與產能的速度都越快。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.essence_furnace": "熔爐",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.essence_furnace.page.1": "基本熔爐可以使用$(l:machines/machine_upgrades)機器升級$()來提升烹煮速度。它們以固體燃料運作，並有內部能量儲存緩衝。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.soul_extractor": "靈魂萃取器",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.soul_extractor.page.1": "靈魂萃取器用來將生物掉落物轉換為生物靈魂。它們以固體燃料運作，並有內部能量儲存緩衝。$(br2)靈魂萃取器能讓你多餘的生物掉落物派上用場，但整體效率通常不如使用$(l:souls/soulium_dagger)離魂匕首$()。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.harvester": "收割機",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.harvester.page.1": "收割機用來自動收割完全成熟的作物。它們以固體燃料運作，並有內部能量儲存緩衝。$(br2)收割機會自動重新種植收割後的作物。$(br2)收割機會把所有資源放入內部物品欄；若空間不足，物品會被放置在作物上。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.harvester.page.2": "收割機每次檢查作物的生長狀況都會消耗少量能量，收割完全成熟的作物則會消耗更多能量。$(br2)這些機器可以使用$(l:machines/machine_upgrades)機器升級$()來強化。$(br2)收割機可用紅石訊號停用。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.soulium_spawner": "離魂生怪器",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.soulium_spawner.page.1": "離魂生怪器使用精華來生成敵對與被動生物。它們以固體燃料運作，並有內部能量儲存緩衝。$(br2)生怪器有內部物品欄，最多可存放 512 個物品。每次運作會消耗一定數量的物品與能量，以生成對應的生物。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.soulium_spawner.page.2": "生怪器會在周圍 3 格半徑內隨機生成生物。$(br2)這些機器可以使用$(l:machines/machine_upgrades)機器升級$()來強化。$(br2)離魂生怪器可用紅石訊號停用。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.blindness_resistance_augment": "抗失明升級",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.blindness_resistance_augment.page.1": "抗失明升級是頭盔升級，穿戴該盔甲時不會受到失明效果影響。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.hunger_resistance_augment": "抗飢餓升級",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.hunger_resistance_augment.page.1": "抗飢餓升級是頭盔升級，穿戴該盔甲時不會受到飢餓效果影響。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.nausea_resistance_augment": "抗反胃升級",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.nausea_resistance_augment.page.1": "抗反胃升級是頭盔升級，穿戴該盔甲時不會受到反胃效果影響。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.slowness_resistance_augment": "抗緩速升級",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.slowness_resistance_augment.page.1": "抗緩速升級是護腿升級，穿戴該盔甲時不會受到緩速效果影響。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.weakness_resistance_augment": "抗虛弱升級",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.weakness_resistance_augment.page.1": "抗虛弱升級是胸甲升級，穿戴該盔甲時不會受到虛弱效果影響。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.luck_augment": "幸運升級",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.luck_augment.page.1": "幸運升級是盔甲升級，穿戴該盔甲時，可改善釣魚或戰利品箱的掉落物。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.haste_augment": "急迫升級",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.haste_augment.page.1": "急迫升級是胸甲升級，穿戴該盔甲時可提升挖掘速度。",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.slow_falling_augment": "緩降升級",
  "book.mysticalagriculture.entry.slow_falling_augment.page.1": "緩降升級是護腿升級，穿戴該盔甲時可獲得緩降效果。$(br2)按住 Shift 鍵可暫時取消此效果。"
}
